ip-text":"使用CJ支付代理服务的订单奖金","payment-agency-cj-order-amount-x":"CJ订单金额 (X)","payment-agency-cj-payment-agency-service-contract":"CJ支付代理服务合同","payment-agency-cjdropshipping-maintains-strong-partnerships-with-multiple-gateways":"CJdropshipping与多个网关保持强大的合作伙伴关系，确保更好的风险控制和更稳定的帐户。","payment-agency-connected-to-major-gateways-with-success-rates-at-an-industry-leading-level":"连接到主要网关，成功率达到行业领先水平。","payment-agency-cooperative-partners":"合作伙伴","payment-agency-deposit":"存款","payment-agency-important-notes":"重要说明","payment-agency-industry-leading-payment-success-rate":"行业领先的支付成功率","payment-agency-lease-fee":"租赁费","payment-agency-lease-fee-tooltip-text":"使用CJ支付代理服务的订单的租赁费","payment-agency-leasing-fees-start-as-low-as-1":"租赁费用开始低至1%。在促销期间，根据您的CJdropshipping购买量享受额外的1%-2% 补贴。","payment-agency-leasing-fees-start-as-low-as-1-during-promotions":"租赁费用开始低至1%。在促销期间，根据您的CJdropshipping购买量享受额外的1%-2% 补贴。","payment-agency-low-leasing-fees-with-promotional-subsidies":"低租赁费和促销补贴","payment-agency-new-customers-with-new-stores":"新商店的新客户","payment-agency-once-your-account-reaches-the-withdrawal-threshold":"一旦您的帐户达到提款阈值，您可以请求付款。您的客户经理将与财务团队协调，在3个工作日内转移资金。","payment-agency-once-your-account-reaches-the-withdrawal-threshold-7":"一旦您的帐户达到提款阈值，您可以请求付款。您的客户经理将与财务团队协调，在7个工作日内转移资金。","payment-agency-once-your-application-for-a-payment-account-is-approved-by-an-account-manager":"一旦您的付款帐户申请获得客户经理的批准，我们将在7至15个工作日内为您设置帐户。","payment-agency-order-amount-tooltip-text":"使用CJ支付代理服务的商店每月CJ订单购买","payment-agency-others":"其他","payment-agency-pricing":"零售价设置","payment-agency-pricing-for-growth-not-for-headaches":"为增长而定价，而不是为头痛而定价","payment-agency-promotion-note-content":"2.PayPal和Stripe支付网关子账户的定价需要单独查询。有关详细信息，请参阅","payment-agency-promotion-note-content-2":"CJdropshipping.com保留对此促销活动的最终解释权。","payment-agency-promotion-notes-1":"1.促销时间: 2025年9月15日-2025年12月31日","payment-agency-promotion-period":"1.促销期间: 2025年9月15日-2025年12月31日","payment-agency-promotion-period-title":"促销期","payment-agency-promotion-period-tooltip-text":"在促销期间注册和连接新商店。","payment-agency-register-a-cjdropshipping-account-and-authorize-your-store":"注册CJdropshipping帐户并授权您的商店","payment-agency-register-a-cjdropshipping-account-and-authorize-your-store.":"注册CJdropshipping帐户并授权您的商店","payment-agency-regular":"常规","payment-agency-seamless-support-for-multiple-dtc-websites":"对多个DTC网站的无缝支持","payment-agency-start-scaling-now-lets-build-your-success":"立即开始扩展: 让我们建立您的成功","payment-agency-step":"步骤","payment-agency-strong-partnerships-and-stable-accounts":"强大的合作伙伴关系和稳定的客户","payment-agency-supports-credit-cards-e-wallets-apple-pay-google-pay-bnpl-and-local-payment-methods":"支持信用卡、电子钱包、Apple Pay、Google Pay、BNPL和本地付款方式。","payment-agency-we-ll-help-you-set-up-your-payment-account":"我们将帮助您设置付款帐户，并持续监控任何潜在的付款问题。","payment-agency-wide-range-of-payment-methods":"广泛的付款方式","payment-agency-works-seamlessly-with-shopify-woocommerce-bigcommerce-and-other-dtc-platforms":"与Shopify、WooCommerce、BigCommerce和其他DTC平台无缝协作。","payment-pay-with-card":"用卡支付","payment-pay-with-wallet":"支付与{{platformName}}钱包","payment-wire-transfer":"电汇","printondemand-startdesign":"开始设计","product-actual-product-photo":"实物图","product-card-added-to-queue":"已添加到队列","product-card-added-to-queue-fail":"添加刊登失败","product-card-free-shipping":"包邮","product-card-list-btn":"刊登","product-card-list-with-on-click":"一键铺货","product-card-normal-inventory-tip":"由于每天的市场变化，供应商的真实库存无法跟踪。要确认，请联系您的代理商。","product-card-please-check-the-product-in-queue.-it-has-been-added-to-queue.":"您已添加该产品到队列。","product-card-print-on-demand":"按需定制","product-card-verify-inventory-tip":"{{siteName}}已确认产品质量和准确的库存。预计48小时内发货。","product-card-view-more":"查看更多","product-listing-notice":"商品上架通知","product-marketing-picture":"营销图","product-marketing-video":"营销视频","product-place-an-order":"去下单","product-th-buyflow-confirm":"确认","product-th-delivery-or-self-pickup":"自提订单商品","product-th-delivery-self-pickup":"送货和自提","product-th-delivery-self-pickup-desc":"您需要前往提货地址，在确认您已经支付物流费用的前提下，拿走您购买订单的商品。","product-th-ordering-process":"订购流程","pr