elect-it-easily":"Tambahkan alamat biasa untuk memilihnya dengan mudah dalam membuat sampel atau pesanan dropshipping.","my-profile-address-add-new-address":"Tambah alamat baru","my-profile-address-address1":"Address1","my-profile-address-address2":"Address2","my-profile-address-are-you-sure-to-delete-this-address":"Anda yakin ingin menghapus alamat ini?","my-profile-address-city":"Kota","my-profile-address-company":"Perusahaan","my-profile-address-consignee-address":"Alamat penerima barang","my-profile-address-consignee-id":"ID penerima barang","my-profile-address-country":"Negara","my-profile-address-county":"County","my-profile-address-default-shipping-address":"Alamat pengiriman Default","my-profile-address-delete-address":"Hapus alamat","my-profile-address-email":"Email","my-profile-address-first-name":"Nama depan","my-profile-address-invalid-phone-please-enter-a-valid-phone":"Telepon tidak valid. Masukkan telepon yang valid.","my-profile-address-invalid-postcode-please-enter-a-valid-postcode":"Kode pos tidak valid. Masukkan kode pos yang valid.","my-profile-address-last-name":"Nama Belakang","my-profile-address-phone-number":"Nomor Telepon","my-profile-address-please-enter-the-address":"Masukkan alamat.","my-profile-address-please-enter-the-first-name":"Masukkan nama depan.","my-profile-address-please-enter-the-last-name":"Masukkan nama belakang.","my-profile-address-please-enter-the-name-of-the-city":"Masukkan nama kota.","my-profile-address-please-enter-the-province-state":"Masukkan provinsi/negara bagian.","my-profile-address-please-select-country":"Pilih negara.","my-profile-address-postcode":"Kode pos","my-profile-address-province":"Provinsi","my-profile-address-region":"Wilayah","my-profile-address-set-as-default-address":"Atur sebagai alamat Default","my-profile-address-set-as-default-consignee":"Atur sebagai penerima Default","my-profile-address-set-as-default-shipping-address":"Atur sebagai alamat pengiriman default","my-profile-address-you-haven-not-added-any-addresses-yet":"Anda belum menambahkan alamat apa pun.","my-profile-cogs-config-bottom-tip-1":"Aplikasi roda gigi","my-profile-cogs-config-bottom-tip-2":"Daftar pesanan menampilkan COGS pesanan dan produk.","my-profile-cogs-config-bottom-tip-3":"Daftar pesanan dapat menyaring pesanan tidak normal melebihi ambang batas dan menyaring pesanan oleh roda.","my-profile-cogs-config-bottom-tip-4":"Setelah berhasil menyimpan perubahan konfigurasi, sistem tidak akan secara otomatis memperbarui data semua menunggu pesanan pembayaran. Saat Anda mengirim pesanan, konfigurasi terbaru akan diterapkan.","my-profile-cogs-config-bottom-tip-5":"Untuk pesanan menunggu pembayaran dan dalam periode kunci pesanan, untuk mendapatkan konfigurasi terbaru, Anda harus memperbarui pesanan secara manual.","my-profile-cogs-config-bottom-tip-6":"Konfigurasi saat ini belum berubah, tidak perlu disimpan.","my-profile-cogs-config-bottom-tip-7":"Silakan melengkapi informasi yang diperlukan bertanda \\"<span class =\\" cogs-btn-tool-tip-inner-memerlukan \\">*</span>\'sebelum berhemat.","my-profile-cogs-config-form-order-cogs-threshold":"Ambang pesanan roda gigi","my-profile-cogs-config-form-order-cogs-threshold-placeholder":"Masukkan","my-profile-cogs-config-form-order-cogs-threshold-solution":"Solusi roda gigi melebihi ambang batas untuk pesanan","my-profile-cogs-config-form-order-cogs-threshold-solution-option-1":"Tidak ada Cepat Atau memblokir penempatan pesanan","my-profile-cogs-config-form-order-cogs-threshold-solution-option-2":"Petunjuk pesanan muncul; Anda dapat menentukan apakah akan melanjutkan ke pesanan.","my-profile-cogs-config-form-order-cogs-threshold-solution-option-3":"Blok pesanan: pesanan tidak dapat dibuat.","my-profile-cogs-config-top-tip-1":"Roda adalah biaya barang per pesanan di toko Anda.","my-profile-cogs-config-top-tip-2":"Roda = Total biaya barang di CJ / Total biaya barang di toko Anda * 100%","my-profile-cogs-config-top-tip-3":"Pesanan yang termasuk layanan pemen