      title: i18next.t('product-buyer-know-ym-tit-1', 'Important Note: After-sales Terms'),
      text: i18next.t('product-note-sh001372-2', "Important Tip 1: <br/>For self-pickup orders, we have five shipping warehouse addresses. Distributors can add these warehouse addresses in the TEMU backend. When you create a delivery note in the TEMU backend, you can create a delivery note for the state that is cheaper. As long as the delivery note is the address we provide, we can ship it. <br/><br/>1. 2220 ALMOND AVE, Redlands, CA, 92374 <br/>2. 1179 Florence Rd, Mansfield, NJ, 08022 <br/>3. 3268 Democrat Rd, Memphis, TN, 38118 <br/>4. 27150 SW Kinsman Road, Wilsonville, OR, 97070 <br/>5. 4178 East Tanners Church Rd, Ellenwood, GA, 30294 <br/><br/>Important Tip 2: <br/>For dropshipping orders, we cannot specify the logistics delivery, we usually use (Amazon Logistics/Ontrac/FedEx). <br/>For self-pickup orders, we only support (FedEx/UPS).")
    },
